{"created": "2026-09-02T13:23:37.878835+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-02T13:23:39.146873+00:00", "id": 21792844, "conceptrecid": "21132087", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21792844", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21132087", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21792844", "metadata": {"title": "QKD Network Characterisation and Coexistence Datasets with Standardised Performance Metrics and Experimental Methods", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21792844", "publication_date": "2026-08-04", "description": "<div>\n<p>This dataset was developed as part of Deliverable D4.2, <em>\"Coexistence Datasets with Standardised Performance Metrics and Methods for Quantum Key Distribution Networks Experimental Measurements\"</em>, and is intended for open-access dissemination and reuse by the research community. This project has received funding from the European Union&rsquo;s DIGITAL Europe Programme under grant agreement No. 101091520</p>\n<p>This dataset presents QKD (Quantum Key Distribution) performance measurements collected on the TCD/CONNECT quantum-classical coexistence testbed, covering<br>five commercial QKD platforms: a Toshiba MU system, two variants of a Toshiba LE system, IDQ Clavis3, and IDQ ClavisXGR. Measurements span two complementary<br>experimental campaigns run on the same testbed:</p>\n<p>- **Coexistence** &mdash; QBER and Secure Key Rate (SKR) for the Toshiba MU system&nbsp; under classical signal injection and varying fibre length, evaluating how quantum and classical traffic coexist on shared optical infrastructure. (Using data from V1 of this Dataset)<br>- **Characterisation** &mdash; full attenuation-sweep QBER/SKR performance for the&nbsp; other four systems running standalone (no coexisting classical signal), plus attenuation-transient (perturbation) response testing on the Toshiba LE research system.</p>\n<p>Experimental data have been cleaned, curated, and organised into structured CSV files containing measurement-level records and JSON files containing descriptive statistics and summary information. The dataset is accompanied by documentation describing the experimental methodology, data structure, variables, and processing procedures.</p>\n<p>The dataset supports reproducible research, benchmarking of QKD coexistence performance, comparative analysis across deployment scenarios, and future studies on the integration of QKD systems into optical communication networks.</p>\n<p><strong>Contents:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Measurement-level datasets (CSV)</li>\n<li>Summary statistics and metadata (JSON)</li>\n<li>Documentation and usage guidelines (README)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Key Variables:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Quantum Bit Error Rate (QBER)</li>\n<li>Secure Key Rate (SKR)</li>\n<li>Optical attenuation (VOA settings)</li>\n<li>Fibre length (0 km and 50 km)</li>\n<li>External signal injection status (On/Off)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Keywords:</strong> Quantum Key Distribution (QKD), Characterisation, Coexistence, Quantum Communications, QBER, Secure Key Rate, Optical Networks, Network Performance, Experimental Dataset, Benchmarking, Fibre Optic Communications.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Horgan, Jerry", "affiliation": "Trinity College Dublin", "orcid": "0000-0001-5783-6077"}, {"name": "Quigley, Niall", "affiliation": "Trinity College Dublin"}, {"name": "Hajar, Bennouri", "affiliation": "Trinity College Dublin", "orcid": "0000-0003-2358-390X"}, {"name": "Briantcev, Dmitrii", "affiliation": "Trinity College Dublin", "orcid": "0000-0002-5170-6447"}, {"name": "Kaszubowska-Anandarajah, Aleksandra", "affiliation": "Trinity College Dublin", "orcid": "0000-0003-4811-9273"}, {"name": "Kilper, Daniel", "affiliation": "Trinity College Dublin", "orcid": "0000-0003-3542-5335"}], "keywords": ["QKD", "Quantum Key Distribution (QKD)", "Quantum Communications", "Quantum Networks", "QKD Networks", "Coexistence", "Quantum Networking", "Quantum Bit Error Rate (QBER)", "Secure Key Rate (SKR)", "Optical Communications", "Optical Networks", "Quantum Security"], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 1, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21132087"}}]}}, "title": "QKD Network Characterisation and Coexistence Datasets with Standardised Performance Metrics and Experimental Methods", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21792844", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21792844?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21792844", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21792844", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21792844", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21132087", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21132087", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21132087", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21132087", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21792844/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21792844/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21792844/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21792844/access", "communities": "https://zenod